# The bar with its times, in the row's whole width: what is played in the middle of
# the room before the bar and what is left in the middle of the room after it, their
# digits (rows 3 to 10 of the text's 14) level with the middle of the bar's body in
# either style. The bar is 8 px shorter at each end for a track of an hour or more
# and 14 px for one of ten, for times with hours.
# The iOS bar: its fill over its track, which hides the theme's, and its knob,
# small as it plays and large as it's moved, by a held button (fast forward and
# rewind), the wheel or the volume
